{"4918480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holy Scrap!", "steam_appid": 4918480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or Get Scrapped: Survive round-based 1 vs 1 duels where every round lost lets you overhaul your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify Your Munitions: Turn basic projectiles into chaotic weapons. Stack modifications to fire shotgun-blasts of massive, freezing rockets to shut down your opponent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutate Your Machine: Don't just upgrade your weapon, re-engineer yourself. Alter your robot's model by shrinking into a speedy microchip or supersize it into a high health iron giant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Across the Cosmos: Clash in dynamic 3D  arenas that change up gameplay. Leap around on a low-gravity moon base, overheat in the lava of a volcano, score hits on a soccer field, or sink to the ocean floor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted Robotic Rumble: Enjoy high stakes FPS action wrapped in a humorous, relaxed package where losing a round just means enjoying new hardware. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or Get Scrapped: Survive round-based 1 vs 1 duels where every round lost lets you overhaul your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify Your Munitions: Turn basic projectiles into chaotic weapons. Stack modifications to fire shotgun-blasts of massive, freezing rockets to shut down your opponent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutate Your Machine: Don't just upgrade your weapon, re-engineer yourself. Alter your robot's model by shrinking into a speedy microchip or supersize it into a high health iron giant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Across the Cosmos: Clash in dynamic 3D  arenas that change up gameplay. Leap around on a low-gravity moon base, overheat in the lava of a volcano, score hits on a soccer field, or sink to the ocean floor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted Robotic Rumble: Enjoy high stakes FPS action wrapped in a humorous, relaxed package where losing a round just means enjoying new hardware. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Blast your friends into spare parts in Holy Scrap! Battle in a wide range of arenas, from the moon to the inside of a volcano. Upgrade your robot after a loss. Shrink yourself, double jump to safety, or turn your bullets into freezing, bouncing rockets! Combine upgrades to find your favorite combo!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918480/57026818383e1bb85fbf96e0d2d1e73eeaad2b26/header.jpg?t=1788206994", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918480/57310ee4dbaf5533c322d9155be6b95e8cb39e14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788206994", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918480/57310ee4dbaf5533c322d9155be6b95e8cb39e14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788206994", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st